    title: "Office Tote Bag Guide: Style That Still Holds a Laptop",
    metaTitle: "Office Tote Bag Guide for Work | CarryCraze",
    metaDescription: "An office tote bag has to hold a laptop, keep its shape and look right in a meeting. Here is how to choose one that manages all three.",
    excerpt: "Most totes fail at work for the same three reasons. Fix those and the tote becomes the most useful bag you own.",
    coverImage: "https://images.pexels.com/photos/7876142/pexels-photo-7876142.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1200",
    author: "CarryCraze Team",
