    metaDescription: "The best commute bag for Indian cities handles crowds, heat, rain and long standing journeys. Here is what to look for before you buy.",
    excerpt: "A metro at peak hour is a harder test than a hiking trail. Here is what a bag needs to survive an Indian city commute.",
    coverImage: "https://images.pexels.com/photos/6107428/pexels-photo-6107428.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1200",
