    title: "What Makes an Office Bag Look Formal Enough for Work",
    metaTitle: "Formal Office Bag: What Actually Works | CarryCraze",
    metaDescription: "A formal office bag is decided by silhouette, material and hardware, not price. Here is exactly what makes a bag read as professional at work.",
    excerpt: "Formality in a bag is not about cost. Five specific details decide whether it reads as professional or casual.",
    coverImage: "https://images.pexels.com/photos/6535358/pexels-photo-6535358.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1200",
    author: "CarryCraze Team",
