    slug: "leather-office-bag-buying-guide",
    title: "Leather Office Bag Guide: What to Check Before You Pay",
    metaTitle: "Leather Office Bag: Buying Guide 2026 | CarryCraze",
    metaDescription: "A leather office bag buying guide covering grain types, edge finishing, hardware and lining, so you can tell real quality from an expensive price tag.",
    excerpt: "Full grain, top grain, genuine leather. The labels are confusing on purpose. Here is how to read a leather bag properly.",
    coverImage: "https://images.pexels.com/photos/9630186/pexels-photo-9630186.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1200",
    author: "CarryCraze Team",
