    title: "The Right Bag to Carry to a Job Interview",
    metaTitle: "Bag for Job Interview: What to Carry | CarryCraze",
    metaDescription: "Choosing a bag for a job interview is about looking prepared without looking loaded. Here is what to carry, what to leave, and what it signals.",
    excerpt: "An interview bag has one job: make you look prepared and unflustered. Here is how to get it right.",
    coverImage: "https://images.pexels.com/photos/13802122/pexels-photo-13802122.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1200",
    author: "CarryCraze Team",
