    metaTitle: "What to Keep in Your Office Bag | CarryCraze",
    metaDescription: "A practical checklist of what to keep in your office bag every day, what to leave at your desk, and what quietly adds weight for no reason.",
    excerpt: "Most office bags carry two kilograms of things nobody uses. Here is the list that actually earns its place.",
    coverImage: "https://images.pexels.com/photos/8730938/pexels-photo-8730938.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1200",
